    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Fuzz and Dizzy, two quirky half-siblings on a mission to save their kingdom in a vibrant turn-based RPG with a nostalgic cartoon aesthetic. Explore a whimsical world filled with hidden surprises, take on mischievous imps in strategic combat, and unlock unique abilities to aid you on your quest. Along the way, uncover a captivating story that unfolds as you progress, immersing you deeper into the adventure. Packed with retro charm, exploration, and heartwarming moments, Fuzz and Dizzy offers a delightful journey for players of all kinds!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Fuzz and Dizzy, two quirky half-siblings on a mission to save their kingdom in a vibrant turn-based RPG with a nostalgic cartoon aesthetic. Explore a whimsical world filled with hidden surprises, take on mischievous imps in strategic combat, and unlock unique abilities to aid you on your quest. Along the way, uncover a captivating story that unfolds as you progress, immersing you deeper into the adventure. Packed with retro charm, exploration, and heartwarming moments, Fuzz and Dizzy offers a delightful journey for players of all kinds!</p>",
    "short_description": "Fuzz and Dizzy is a quirky turn-based RPG inspired by the charm of vintage cartoons. With its retro art style and lively animations, the game brings the world of these half-sibling mail carriers to life as they navigate their biggest challenge yet: saving their kingdom from the chaos caused by imps.",
